[{"answer":"So the counselling services we offer deal with any problems arising from your studies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/1.mp3"},{"answer":"or in your life outside the university.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Let's take academic counselling.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/3.mp3"},{"answer":"If you're confused about subjects or how to combine them in your degree,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/4.mp3"},{"answer":"then we can advise you and discuss the career you are aiming for,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/5.mp3"},{"answer":"so that you can see it all in context.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We can also chase up your tutor if you're not getting proper feedback on how you are getting on in your subject.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Besides help with academic problems,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/8.mp3"},{"answer":"you may also need personal counselling:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/9.mp3"},{"answer":"if you think you're already under stress,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/10.mp3"},{"answer":"well, just wait till classes begin next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/11.mp3"},{"answer":"You'll have to start adjusting to teaching and learning methods that may be unfamiliar to you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/12.mp3"},{"answer":"as well as the mounting pressure as the deadline for that first assignment creeps up on you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/13.mp3"},{"answer":"And of course, you have to cope with all this without your usual social network -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/14.mp3"},{"answer":"you know, the social contacts, family and friends you could normally rely on for help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/15.mp3"},{"answer":"All of this causes anxiety.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Studying overseas can trigger a personal crisis -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/17.mp3"},{"answer":"you may have left a lot of what you might call 'unfinished business' back in your own country,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/18.mp3"},{"answer":"or you may have interrupted personal relationships","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/19.mp3"},{"answer":"or even sometimes have broken them off to come overseas,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/20.mp3"},{"answer":"and so the student often feels lonely, unhappy, unmotivated","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and unable to concentrate on studying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Or there may be other things bothering you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Our resident chaplain can offer you spiritual guidance if that's what you want,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/24.mp3"},{"answer":"or we can put you in touch with community groups that can provide you with social contacts and friendship.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/25.mp3"},{"answer":"What about exam stress?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It affects nearly everyone to some extent,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/27.mp3"},{"answer":"but especially overseas students like yourselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/28.mp3"},{"answer":"There may be a huge amount of family pressure on you to succeed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and if you fail a subject or drop out of a course because it's too difficult","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/30.mp3"},{"answer":"then your self-esteem can suffer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/31.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's not the end of the world if you don't pass an exam -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I had to resit First Year Anthropology, so I can certainly offer you a sympathetic ear!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, exam failure can lead to worrying changes in the way you normally behave.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/34.mp3"},{"answer":"You may also be off your food,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/35.mp3"},{"answer":"or you may have dietary problems","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/36.mp3"},{"answer":"because the local food is not to your liking and upsets you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and this can affect your health and studies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Glenda Roberts is our dietician in the Health Service","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and we can put you on to her.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/40.mp3"},{"answer":"And we all have money problems, don't we?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/41.mp3"},{"answer":"But remember, full-time students can get a low-interest loan of up to six hundred dollars to buy books","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and for similar study-related expenses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/43.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can get double that amount if you can't afford an item of equipment you need for your course -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/45.mp3"},{"answer":"a musical instrument, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And it doesn't stop there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/47.mp3"},{"answer":"When you move into a flat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/48.mp3"},{"answer":"starting-up expenses, including furniture for it,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/49.mp3"},{"answer":"can be covered by a loan through the Welfare Service.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/50.mp3"},{"answer":"See Jill Freeman for details.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Can we help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, last academic year, in spite of staff cuts,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/53.mp3"},{"answer":"we counselled 240 international students for a total of 2600 hours counselling,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/54.mp3"},{"answer":"and, finally we won all but just 1 of the 12 appeals that we launched on behalf of students.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Not too bad for an understaffed service, don't you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/56.mp3"},{"answer":"That's all from me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-2-2023-08-11-20-38-12/58.mp3"}]
